menu "Metrics"
    config HUB_METRICS_MAX
        int "Maximum number of metric keys"
        default 128
        range 8 256
        help
            Table full: a new key replaces the oldest stale one (a renamed or removed probe);
            without a stale one it is dropped with an error and a warning on the display.
            Set it just below the number of keys in "show status" to test that.
endmenu
